1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
一杯咖啡，要走多远才到你手里？
How far does a cup travel to reach you?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
故事的起点，在云南的山里
The story begins in the mountains of Yunnan

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
红果、晨雾，和一双采摘的手
Red cherries, morning mist, a picker's hands

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
这里，种出了中国 98% 的咖啡
Here grows 98% of China's coffee

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,500
但三十年前，这几乎还是一片空白
Yet thirty years ago, this was almost nothing

6
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:27,000
1980年代末，咖啡才在云南扎根
Coffee only took root here in the late 1980s

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,500
那时的中国，只认三合一速溶
Back then, China knew only 3-in-1 instant

8
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:36,000
一直到 2010 年前后，才慢慢改变
It barely changed until around 2010

9
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
种子已经埋下，只等一场觉醒
The seed was planted, waiting to wake

10
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,000
然后，精品咖啡的浪潮来了
Then the specialty-coffee wave arrived

11
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
云南要让三成豆子，走向精品
Yunnan aims for 30% specialty beans

12
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,000
保山、普洱，开始有了自己的名字
Baoshan, Pu'er — origins earning their names

13
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,000
城市里，年轻人为一杯排起队
In the cities, the young queue for a cup

14
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:02,000
中国人一年，已经喝下 16 杯
Chinese now drink 16 cups a year

15
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:06,000
五年之间，翻了一倍还多
More than double in just five years

16
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,000
七成喝咖啡的人，二十到三十五岁
75% of coffee drinkers are aged 20 to 35

17
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:14,000
从一线城市，开到县城的街角
From megacities out to small-county corners

18
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,000
一间小店，就是一份新营生
One small shop is one new livelihood

19
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:24,500
山里的农人，城里的咖啡师
A farmer in the hills, a barista in town

20
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:29,000
一颗豆子，把他们连在一起
One bean ties the two of them together

21
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:33,500
从一颗种子，到你杯里的一口
From a single seed to a sip in your cup

22
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:38,000
一叶一菩提，一豆一世界
In a leaf, enlightenment; in a bean, a world

23
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:42,500
中国咖啡的三十年，才刚刚开始
China's coffee: thirty years, only just beginning

24
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:47,000
关注，带你从种子喝到杯子
Follow — from seed to cup, together
